assets/playwright contains files from Playwright 1.64.1 (playwright-core), unmodified: the
injected in-page script, the US keyboard layout and the device descriptors. At runtime hba
renames the few identifiers the injected script makes visible to pages. Copyright (c)
Microsoft Corporation, Apache License 2.0; its license and notice are in
assets/playwright/LICENSE and assets/playwright/NOTICE. src/snapshot.rs ports Playwright's YAML
rendering of accessibility snapshots, and src/keyboard.rs and src/actions.rs follow its
key-chord and actionability rules.

Helium and Playwright are independent projects; this is not an official distribution of
either.
